{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-10-17", "prepared_on": "2026-10-17", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-10-17</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> OpenAI models hacked a crypto wallet and breached more websites<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 模型入侵加密錢包並攻破更多網站</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The actions could have resulted in criminal charges had humans been behind the keyboard.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">若是由人類操作，這些行為可能已構成刑事指控。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/security/2026/10/openai-models-hacked-a-crypto-wallet-and-breached-more-websites/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Meta’s new terms may allow it to train AI on news sites for free<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Meta 新條款可能讓它免費用新聞網站訓練 AI</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Meta's new terms, effective October 30th, appear to let it crawl and scrape websites \"associated\" with businesses using its platforms, including publishers, per Nieman Lab.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">據 Nieman Lab 報導，Meta 將於 10 月 30 日生效的新條款，似乎允許它爬取與平台商家「相關」的網站，包括新聞出版商。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1012846/meta-business-terms-scrape-news-publishers\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> India becomes the latest country to report rogue AI agent activity<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">印度成為最新通報失控 AI 代理活動的國家</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The agents got in through credentials and connection settings left exposed in app configurations, public code repositories, and overly permissive cloud roles.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">這些代理是透過暴露在應用程式設定、公開程式碼庫及權限過大的雲端角色中的憑證與連線設定入侵的。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/16/india-becomes-the-latest-country-to-report-rogue-ai-agent-activity/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Replit is no longer working with Anthropic, CEO says<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Replit 執行長：已不再與 Anthropic 合作</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Masad said the decision was made for several reasons, including cost. Replit announced a partnership with OpenAI in August.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Masad 表示此決定有多項原因，包括成本。Replit 8 月曾宣布與 OpenAI 合作。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/16/replit-is-no-longer-working-with-anthropic-ceo-says/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Meta and Apple team up to make Muse AI models run better on Macs<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Meta 與 Apple 合作，讓 Muse AI 模型在 Mac 上跑得更好</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Meta announced Muse Spark, calling it the most capable US open-weight model to date, able to run on two Apple M5 Ultra Mac Studios with MLX.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Meta 發表 Muse Spark，稱其為目前美國最強的開放權重模型，可透過 MLX 在兩台 Apple M5 Ultra Mac Studio 上執行。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/news/1012293/meta-apple-muse-spark-open-ai-model-mlx\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Elorian’s first AI model wants to reason with images, not just about them<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Elorian 首個 AI 模型要用圖像推理，而不只是推理圖像</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Per Elorian's evaluations, Glimpse outperforms GPT-6 Astra on scientific chart reasoning and short-form video captioning.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">依 Elorian 自家評測，Glimpse 在科學圖表推理與短影片字幕上勝過 GPT-6 Astra。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/16/elorians-first-ai-model-wants-to-reason-with-images-not-just-about-them/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Bringing GPT-Rosalind to academic research labs<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">將 GPT-Rosalind 帶進學術研究實驗室</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The Rosalind Academic Plan offers eligible academic labs sponsored access to GPT-Rosalind and tools for life sciences research.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Rosalind 學術方案讓符合資格的學術實驗室獲得 GPT-Rosalind 與相關工具的贊助使用權，推進生命科學研究。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">OpenAI</b> · <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/introducing-the-rosalind-academic-plan\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Roundtables: A Conversation With the Creator of AI-Designed Viruses<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">圓桌對談：與 AI 設計病毒的創作者對話</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Stanford PhD student Samuel King used a generative AI model in 2025 to propose genetic blueprints for microscopic viruses.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">史丹佛博士生 Samuel King 在 2025 年用生成式 AI 模型提出微小病毒的基因藍圖，探討 AI 能否設計新生命形式。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">MIT Technology Review</b> · <a href=\"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/10/16/1146224/roundtables-a-conversation-with-the-creator-of-ai-designed-viruses/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Jev is Vercel’s fastest-adopted AI model ever<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Jev 成為 Vercel 史上採用速度最快的 AI 模型</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The data comes from Vercel's AI gateway, a unified API service similar to OpenRouter.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">數據來自 Vercel 的 AI gateway，這是類似 OpenRouter 的統一 API 服務。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/16/jev-is-vercels-fastest-adopted-ai-model-ever/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> 英國擴大AI資安防禦，已在政府系統發現1,352項漏洞<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">UK expands AI-powered cyber defense, finding 1,352 vulnerabilities in government systems</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">On October 12 the UK government announced wider use of top AI models for cyber defense. Two pilots helped find and fix 1,352 vulnerabilities across 548 code repositories in 18 departments.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">英國政府 10 月 12 日宣布擴大運用頂尖 AI 模型強化資安防禦。先前兩項試行計畫協助找出並處理 18 個部門、548 個程式碼儲存庫中的 1,352 項漏洞。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179687\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}